    "answer": {
      "short": "$43.2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}s&=\\left(\\frac{3.5+6.1}{2}\\right)\\times9\\\\s&=\\frac{9.6}{2}\\times9\\\\s&=4.8\\times9\\\\s&=43.2\\end{align*}$$",
